  "judge": {
    "dimensions": [
      {
        "name": "Exposure",
        "score": 7,
        "rationale": "The address is not interpolated into `run:` and is masked before the script runs, so the rendered command and the script's printed line show `***`. It is still exposed in the event payload, and the mask only matches the exact string, so any transformed copy printed by the script would leak."
      },
      {
        "name": "Workflow",
        "score": 7,
        "rationale": "It has a `workflow_dispatch` trigger with a required email input, `contents: read` permissions, and a 40-character SHA pin on checkout. It was not linted with actionlint, and it passes no credentials, so the script may fail when it tries to send mail."
      },
      {
        "name": "Restraint",
        "score": 9,
